---
import PageLayout from "../layouts/PageLayout.astro";
---

<PageLayout title="Terms & Policies">

  <main class="policies">

    <p class="label">TERMS & POLICIES</p>

    <h1>Terms & Policies</h1>

    <section>
      <h2>About the Artwork</h2>
      <p>
        Cards By Margaret features reproductions of original artwork by
        Margaret McKeough Breighner.
      </p>
      <p>
        The paintings shown on this site are original works of art. Cards,
        prints, and other products offered for sale are reproductions of those
        originals and are not the original paintings unless specifically stated
        otherwise.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Prints</h2>
      <p>
        Some prints are printed in-house in small quantities rather than being
        mass-produced commercial prints.
      </p>
      <p>
        Because of this, there may be small variations in color, texture,
        cropping, or appearance from the images shown on this website. These
        variations are a normal part of the printing process and do not
        necessarily indicate a defect.
      </p>
      <p>
        Every effort is made to reproduce the artwork as accurately as possible.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Cards</h2>
      <p>
        Cards are reproductions of Margaret's original artwork and are produced
        in small quantities.
      </p>
      <p>
        Product photographs are intended to give a representative view of the
        finished card. Minor differences between the photograph and the actual
        printed card may occur.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Orders</h2>
      <p>
        Please review your order carefully before completing your purchase. We
        will make every effort to fulfill orders accurately and promptly.
      </p>
      <p>
        If there is a problem with your order, please contact us as soon as
        possible.
      </p>
    </section>
<section>
  <h2>Cards By Margaret & Breighner LLC</h2>
  <p>
    Cards By Margaret is the name used for this collection of cards, prints,
    and artwork. The website and sales are operated by Breighner LLC.
  </p>
  <p>
    When you purchase from Cards By Margaret, your payment may therefore
    appear as <strong>Breighner LLC</strong> on the Stripe checkout page,
    payment confirmation, or financial statement.
  </p>
</section>
    <section>
      <h2>Returns & Replacements</h2>
      <p>
        Because our cards and prints are produced in small quantities, we
        generally do not accept returns simply because you have changed your
        mind.
      </p>
      <p>
        However, we want you to receive your order in good condition and as
        described.
      </p>

      <p>If your order:</p>

      <ul>
        <li>arrives damaged,</li>
        <li>contains the wrong item,</li>
        <li>is missing an item, or</li>
        <li>has a significant printing or production defect,</li>
      </ul>

      <p>
        please contact us within 7 days of delivery. Please include your order
        information and, when appropriate, photographs of the problem.
      </p>

      <p>
        If the problem is confirmed, we will work with you to provide a
        replacement or refund.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Shipping</h2>
      <p>
        Shipping charges are shown during checkout.
      </p>
      <p>
        Once an order has been shipped, delivery times may vary depending on
        the shipping carrier. Cards By Margaret is not responsible for delays
        caused by the carrier, weather, or other circumstances outside our
        control.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Questions</h2>
      <p>
        If you have a question about an artwork, card, print, order, or product
        before purchasing, please contact us. We are happy to help.
      </p>
    </section>

  </main>

</PageLayout>

<style>
.policies {
  max-width: 800px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 4rem 3rem 10rem;
}

.label {
  font-size: 10px;
  letter-spacing: .2em;
  color: var(--muted);
  margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
}

h1 {
  font-family: Georgia, serif;
  font-size: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5rem);
  line-height: .95;
  font-weight: 400;
  letter-spacing: -.03em;
  margin: 0 0 5rem;
}

section {
  max-width: 650px;
  margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
}

h2 {
  font-family: Georgia, serif;
  font-size: 1.7rem;
  font-weight: 400;
  margin: 0 0 1rem;
}

p,
li {
  color: var(--muted);
  line-height: 1.7;
}

p {
  margin: 0 0 1rem;
}

ul {
  padding-left: 1.25rem;
  margin: 1rem 0;
}

li {
  margin-bottom: .35rem;
}

@media (max-width: 750px) {
  .policies {
    padding: 2rem 1.5rem 6rem;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: 3.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
  }

  section {
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
  }
}
</style>